{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22044","headline":"新乐府 法曲\t美列圣，正华声也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 法曲\t美列圣，正华声也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法曲法曲歌大定，积德重熙有余庆。\n永徽之人舞而咏，法曲法曲舞霓裳。\n政和世理音洋洋，开元之人乐且康。\n法曲法曲歌堂堂，堂堂之庆垂无疆。\n中宗肃宗复鸿业，唐祚中兴万万叶。\n法曲法曲合夷歌，夷声邪乱华声和。\n以乱干和天宝末，明年胡尘犯宫阙。\n乃知法曲本华风，苟能审音与政通。\n一从胡曲相参错，不辨兴衰与哀乐。\n愿求牙旷正华音，不令夷夏相交侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}